## -----------------------------------------------------------------
## Produkt (Product) Service Sub-Profile — SKELETON
## -----------------------------------------------------------------
## ROLE: Placeholder profile for the product service. Records which
##       NeTEx fare-product objects the service relates to. SKELETON
##       only — the real consumes/produces sets and SHACL constraints
##       must be filled in once the product model is confirmed.
##
## Peer of the other service sub-profiles: imports netex-entur.ttl,
## never another sub-profile. The income model builds on products.
##
## Imports: netex-entur.ttl (Entur governance + codespaces)
##          → netex-nordic.ttl → generated NeTEx base (netex:) + nordic vocab
##
## Generated: 2026-08-12
## -----------------------------------------------------------------

@prefix netex:   <https://netex-cen.eu/ontology#> .
@prefix profile: <https://netex-cen.eu/profile#> .
@prefix entur:   <https://entur.org/ontology#> .
@prefix produkt: <https://entur.org/service/produkt#> .
@prefix sh:      <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#> .
@prefix rdfs:    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix owl:     <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix skos:    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#> .

## --- Import Entur governance ---
<https://entur.org/service/produkt> a owl:Ontology ;
    owl:imports <https://entur.org/ontology> .

## =================================================================
## SERVICE DEFINITION
## =================================================================

produkt:ProductService a entur:SubProfile ;
    rdfs:label "Produkt — Product Service Profile (skeleton)" ;
    skos:definition "Sub-profile for the product catalogue (fare products, sales offers). Skeleton — constraints to be confirmed." ;
    entur:basedOn profile:NP .

## =================================================================
## OBJECTS IN SCOPE (provisional)
## =================================================================
## Likely NeTEx fare-product touchpoints. Confirm against the
## generated base before adding SHACL.
## -----------------------------------------------------------------

produkt:ProductService produkt:requiresClass
    netex:PreassignedFareProduct ,
    netex:SalesOfferPackage ,
    netex:UsageParameter .

## PROPOSAL: Fill in produkt:consumes / produkt:produces and add
## produkt:P_{ClassName}Shape constraints once the product model is
## confirmed. Verify the class list against the generated NeTEx base.

## =================================================================
## END OF PRODUCT SERVICE PROFILE (skeleton)
## =================================================================
